From 84eb1161c77e7116fac08629511aa2e0e2063ad6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jason Macnak <natsu@google.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 10:05:59 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] WIP: gpu: fencing

Pass fence metadata into process_gpu_command(), return GpuFenceResult to
indicate immediate vs deferred descriptor completion, and centralize
timeline deferral and signaling on FenceState.

Bug: b/577098280
