 devices/src/virtio/gpu/mod.rs        | 294 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-----------
 devices/src/virtio/gpu/virtio_gpu.rs |  55 +++++--
 2 files changed, 243 insertions(+), 106 deletions(-)

